  light_material_sync_mode text [not null, default: 'materialGlowTintsLight', note: 'Property light:materialSyncMode (no description in schema.usda). Uniform: one value, not time-sampled.; source: uniform token light:materialSyncMode']
  Note: 'MeshLightAPI: This is the preferred API schema to apply to Mesh type prims when adding light behaviors to a mesh. At its base, this API schema has the built-in behavior of applying LightAPI to the mesh and overriding the default materialSyncMode to allow the emission/glow of the bound material to affect the color of the light.'
