  Note: 'ModelAPI: UsdModelAPI is an API schema that provides an interface to a prim\'s model qualities, if it does, in fact, represent the root prim of a model. The first and foremost model quality is its kind, i.e. the metadata that establishes it as a model (See KindRegistry).'
