  Note: 'ParticleField: A ParticleField prim is used as a base to describe different types of concrete ParticleField implementations, such as, but not limited to, 3D Gaussian Splats. It is a concrete prim type that can have different ParticleField related applied schemas applied to it, to specialize its definition.'
