  sorting_mode_hint text [not null, default: 'zDepth', note: 'A hint for the renderer on how to sort the gaussians while drawing. Uniform: one value, not time-sampled.; source: uniform token sortingModeHint']
  Note: 'ParticleField3DGaussianSplat: 04079). It inherits from the ParticleField base prim, and has a set of applied schema automatically applied to provide the required attributes to define the necessary data from the original 3DGS paper.'
