  physics_density float8 [not null, default: 0, note: 'If non-zero, defines the density of the material. Varying: may carry time samples (animatable).; source: float physics:density']
  Note: 'PhysicsMaterialAPI: Adds simulation material properties to a Material. All collisions that have a relationship to this material will have their collision response defined through this material.'
