  physics_angular_velocity_z float8 [not null, default: 0, note: 'Angular velocity in the same space as the node\'s xform. Varying: may carry time samples (animatable). (z); source: vector3f physics:angularVelocity']
  Note: 'PhysicsRigidBodyAPI: Applies physics body attributes to any UsdGeomXformable prim and marks that prim to be driven by a simulation. If a simulation is running it will update this prim\'s pose.'
