  length float8 [not null, default: 2, note: 'The length of the plane, which aligns to the y-axis when axis is \'Z\' or \'X\', or to the z-axis when axis is \'Y\'. Varying: may carry time samples (animatable).; source: double length']
  axis text [not null, default: 'Z', note: 'The axis along which the surface of the plane is aligned. Uniform: one value, not time-sampled.; source: uniform token axis']
  Note: 'Plane: Defines a primitive plane, centered at the origin, and is defined by a cardinal axis, width, and length. The plane is double-sided by default.'
