  value_z float8 [not null, note: 'Element value (float3). Varying: may carry time samples (animatable). (z); source: float3[] extent']
  Note: 'Plane.extent: One element of the ordered float3[] array extent of Plane. Extent is re-defined on Plane only to provide a fallback value.'
